<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball - Results of Philippine pro league.</title>
<headline>Basketball - Results of Philippine pro league.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the elimination round games on Saturday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Sunkist Orange 99-93 (49-48)</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat San Miguel Beer 110-85 (49-42)</p>
